{"title": "Ask HN: Who Owns API Drift", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597066", "summary": "<p>Your app consumes a 3rd party api, the providers announce changes or sometimes they don't.\nYou miss the announcements, now you are debugging at 2 am that if nothing was pushed why the app broke.<p>You debug it and find provider changed something in API. How'd you tackle that?\nHave you ever lived through pain of API drift?\nWho fixes that?<p>Do you have any solution?</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597066\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597066</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>", "published": "2026-11-22T07:12:08+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Ask HN: Who Owns API Drift", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597066", "published_at": "2026-11-22T07:12:08+00:00", "summary": "<p>Your app consumes a 3rd party api, the providers announce changes or sometimes they don't.\nYou miss the announcements, now you are debugging at 2 am that if nothing was pushed why the app broke.<p>You debug it and find provider changed something in API. How'd you tackle that?\nHave you ever lived through pain of API drift?\nWho fixes that?<p>Do you have any solution?</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597066\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597066</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-11-22T07:47:54.418800+00:00"}
