{"title": "Ask HN: Is Anthropic being public better or worse for your org?", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597005", "summary": "<p>Now that Anthropic has a \"fiduciary duty to maximize shareholder value\"*, have you or your org started thinking about what that means medium to long term? For example, if you are using their models in production or production-adjacent systems, how do price changes impact your business?<p>* I know they have a complicated governing system, but at the end of the day they have different pressures now than when they were private.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597005\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597005</a></p>\n<p>Points: 3</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>", "published": "2026-11-22T06:59:40+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Ask HN: Is Anthropic being public better or worse for your org?", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597005", "published_at": "2026-11-22T06:59:40+00:00", "summary": "<p>Now that Anthropic has a \"fiduciary duty to maximize shareholder value\"*, have you or your org started thinking about what that means medium to long term? For example, if you are using their models in production or production-adjacent systems, how do price changes impact your business?<p>* I know they have a complicated governing system, but at the end of the day they have different pressures now than when they were private.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597005\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50597005</a></p>\n<p>Points: 3</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-1